 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Waves crashing on seaside homes yesterday in Malibu, Calif. Photo: David Swanson/AFP via Getty Images 🌊 More than 30 homes in Malibu, Calif., are under evacuation orders amid coastal flooding and erosion. Offshore storms have caused significant damage, including a massive sinkhole outside actor Nicolas Cage's $10.5 million beachfront home. Go deeper . 🧑‍⚖️ The lone juror who blocked Lindsay Clancy from being acquitted in Plymouth, Mass., insisted that he wouldn't find her not guilty by reason of insanity despite saying that he had reasonable doubt, the jury's foreperson said in an interview. Go deeper . 🏌️‍♂️ LIV Golf is asking a bankruptcy judge's permission to reject its player contracts, including lucrative deals with stars Bryson DeChambeau, Jon Rahm and Phil Mickelson. More from Nathan Bomey . 
 
